{
	"name": "Ehler's Armor",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/equipment/chest/coat-collared-red-gold.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Originally created by a loving mother for her hypermobile child, Ehler’s armor consists of several components. The first, and potentially most important part, is an exceptionally tight suit of clothes with corset-enclosures for tightening on the limbs. Over this is worn a comfortable long jacket or gambeson. The armor component involves various rings and bars that are designed to rest over the joints of the arms, hips, legs, and ankles to help keep joints from rolling or flexing too far.</p><p>The final piece is a set of rings and bars worn on the hands and around the knuckles, again to provide stability for the proper extension of the fingers. Ehler’s armor can be worn as an armor of it’s own, making your AC 12 + Dex mod, or be worn as a padding layer under a medium or heavy armor.</p>",
